# Cursor Rules - Personal Portfolio API Project
# Microsoft Principal Engineer Best Practices & Standards

## Project Overview
This is a TypeScript/Express.js Personal Portfolio API with the following architecture:
- **Backend**: Node.js + Express.js + TypeScript
- **Database**: SQLite with Prisma ORM (development) / MySQL (production)
- **Authentication**: Dual JWT-based authentication (Admin + User)
- **User Management**: Complete user registration, login, and profile management
- **Admin Dashboard**: User statistics and management capabilities
- **E-commerce Features**: Shopping cart and favorite products for users
- **File Upload**: Multer for image/file handling
- **Deployment**: Docker + Production ready

