### Development Setup
```bash
# Environment variables required
NODE_ENV=development
DATABASE_URL="file:./prisma/dev.db"
JWT_SECRET="your-secret-key"

# Start development server
npm run build && npm start

# Create admin user (via seed script)
npx tsx src/scripts/seed.ts
# Default admin: username="admin", password="admin123"
```

Remember: This project serves a personal portfolio with admin panel, user management, e-commerce features, multi-domain support, and file upload capabilities. Always maintain the existing patterns and security measures.

